<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Training & Professional Development</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Build a future-ready organization through structured skills tracking, targeted 
            learning interventions, and rigorous analysis of development impact.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Needs Analysis & Curated Learning</h2>
        <p>
            The training journey begins with deep analytical insight. The Training Needs Analysis 
            (TNA) engine automatically derives skill gaps from performance reviews and 
            future organizational role requirements. This data-driven approach ensures 
            that your training budget is deployment where it will have the maximum impact 
            on operational performance. Manage a comprehensive training calendar 
            that integrates internal workshops, external certifications, and e-learning 
            milestones into a unified development plan for every team.
        </p>
        <p>
            SCORM-compatible LMS (Learning Management System) components allow for the hosting 
            and tracking of basic e-learning modules, ensuring that induction and 
            compliance training can be completed independently and efficiently.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Certification & Qualification Stewardship</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain absolute organizational compliance. The system centrally tracks all 
            employee certifications and professional qualifications, providing automated 
            alerts to both the employee and HR management well in advance of expiration. 
            This stewardship is critical for highly regulated industries like 
            healthcare, finance, or heavy industry, ensuring that no professional 
            is performing tasks they are not currently authorized to undertake.
        </p>
        <p>
            Digital archival of certificates and course completion evidence provides a 
            verifiable, audit-ready record for regulatory bodies and professional 
            standards organizations (such as SAZ or ISO auditors).
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Development ROI & Expenditure Analytics</h2>
        <p>
            Quantify the return on your professional development investment. The system tracks 
            every training expenditure down to the individual employee and department level. 
            By correlating training completion with subsequent performance rating 
            improvements, the Training ROI module helps leadership identify the most 
            effective learning providers and intervention types, optimizing the 
            expenditure for maximum organizational growth.
        </p>
        <p>
            Consolidated training reports provide the data necessary for ZIMDEF returns and 
            other statutory learning requirements, ensuring that your organization 
            receives full credit for its commitment to workforce development.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

